        <p>Every Wednesday. One sharp tactic, one Boolean, one candidate pattern. No fluff.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="num">PILLAR II</span>
        <h4>The playbooks</h4>
        <p>Deep-dive guides on a single role family — ML platform, applied research, eval, infra.</p>
